### J6.1 — Program.cs & Host: request collection
### VS Code (REST Client / Humao extension), JetBrains Rider and Visual Studio 2022+ run this file directly.
### Start the app first:  cd WebApp && dotnet run -- J6.1
### Watch the server console too: the "pipeline out" lines (middleware 2 -> middleware 1) show the response direction.

@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1) The hint endpoint — lists what this demo offers
GET {{host}}/

### 2) The request journey — Kestrel -> middleware 1 -> routing -> middleware 2 -> endpoint -> response
GET {{host}}/pipeline

### 3) Unknown path — routing finds no endpoint; middleware 1 and 2 still run, the response is 404
GET {{host}}/does-not-exist

### 4) Wrong method — no endpoint matches POST /pipeline -> 405 Method Not Allowed (a path match with the wrong method is not a 404)
POST {{host}}/pipeline
